      "title": "Washington & Jefferson College Athletics",
      "description": "Faculty/Staff Coach Mentor Program - Washington & Jefferson College Athletics Skip To Main Content Pause All Rotators Washington & Jefferson College Athletics Official athletic website of the Washington & Jefferson Presidents Main Baseball Baseball: Schedule Baseball: Roster Baseball: News Basketball Basketball: Schedule Basketball: Roster Basketball: News Cross Country Cross Country: Schedule Cross Country: Roster Cross Country: News (RV) Football (RV) Football: Schedule (RV) Football: Roster (RV) Football: News Golf Golf: Schedule Golf: Roster Golf: News Lacrosse Lacrosse: Schedule Lacrosse: Roster Lacrosse: News Soccer Soccer: Schedule Soccer: Roster Soccer: News Swimming & Diving Swimming & Diving: Schedule Swimming & Diving: Roster Swimming & Diving: News Tennis Tennis: Schedule Tennis: Roster Tennis: News Track & Field Track & Field: Schedule Track & Field: Roster Track & Field: News Water Polo Water Polo: Schedule Water Polo: Roster Water Polo: News Wrestling Wrestling: Schedule Wrestling: Roster Wrestling: News Volleyball Volleyball: Schedule Volleyball: Roster Volleyball: News Basketball Basketball: Schedule Basketball: Roster Basketball: News Cross Country Cross Country: Schedule Cross Country: Roster Cross Country: News Field Hockey Field Hockey: Schedule Field Hockey: Roster Field Hockey: News Golf Golf: Schedule Golf: Roster Golf: News Lacrosse Lacrosse: Schedule Lacrosse: Roster Lacrosse: News Soccer Soccer: Schedule Soccer: Roster Soccer: News Softball Softball: Schedule Softball: Roster Softball: News Swimming & Diving Swimming & Diving: Schedule Swimming & Diving: Roster Swimming & Diving: News Tennis Tennis: Schedule Tennis: Roster Tennis: News Track & Field Track & Field: Schedule Track & Field: Roster Track & Field: News Volleyball Volleyball: Schedule Volleyball: Roster Volleyball: News Water Polo Water Polo: Schedule Water Polo: Roster Water Polo: News Wrestling Wrestling: Schedule Wrestling: Roster Wrestling: News Staff Directory Donate To Athletics Gameday Programs Live Video Composite Schedule Sports Medicine Sports Information Hall of Fame Nominate for W&J Hall of Fame History Department Awards SAAC Faculty/Staff Mentors EADA Survey Student-Athlete Handbook PAC Affiliations NCAA Championships Prezpy Award Winners Brooks Park Cameron Stadium Salvitti Family Gymnasium Ross Recreation Center Henry Natatorium Swanson Tennis Center Ross Memorial Park Alexandre Stadium Overview Recruiting Information W&J Future Students Apply washjeff.edu BSN Sideline Store Faculty/Staff Coach Mentor Program Washington & Jefferson College instituted a faculty/staff mentor program in 2007 to provide a valuable link between the student-athletes and the faculty and staff.  This program allows faculty and staff members to serve as advocates for students participating in a given sport and fosters a working relationship between the faculty, staff, and coaching staff. Faculty/staff team mentors enrich the overall experience for team members, encourage student athletes to be fully engaged in the curriculum and community and provide faculty/staff colleagues with understanding of the mission of intercollegiate athletics. Below are the faculty members and the teams they currently work with.  For more information on the program or how to get involved, e-mail Director of Athletics Scott McGuinness at smcguinness@washjeff.edu . NCAA Faculty Representative Tim Klitz ( tklitz@washjeff.edu ), Psychology; Women's Soccer Faculty Mentor Baseball Dana Mialki ( dmialki@washjeff.edu ), Accounting Men's Basketball Sean Coyne ( scoyne@washjeff.edu ), Psychology Women's Basketball Jamie March ( jmarch@washjeff.edu ), Biology Cross Country/Track & Field Kirsten McMichael ( kmcmichael@washjeff.edu ), Physics Zack Klingensmith ( jklingensmith2@washjeff.edu ), Economics Field Hockey Rebecca Rapp ( rrapp@washjeff.edu ), Computing and Information Studies Football Annette Drew-Bear ( adrewbear@washjeff.edu ), English Tiffani Gottschall ( tgottschall@washjeff.edu ), Economics Golf Robert Dunn ( rdunn@washjeff.edu ), Economics Men's Lacrosse Karin Maresh ( kmaresh@washjeff.edu ), Communication Arts Women's Lacrosse Tiffani Gottschall ( tgottschall@washjeff.edu ), Economics Men's Soccer Buba Misawa ( bmisawa@washjeff.edu ), Political Science Women's Soccer Tim Klitz ( tklitz@washjeff.edu ), Psychology Softball Melissa Cook ( mcook@ washjeff.edu ), Communication Arts Men's and Women's Swimming and Diving Jason Kilgore ( jkilgore@washjeff.edu ), Biology Men's and Women's Tennis Mark Swift ( mswift@washjeff.edu ), Music Men's Volleyball TBA Women's Volleyball Leslie Dunn ( ldunn@washjeff.edu ), Economics Men's and Women's Water Polo Kyle Dickey ( kdickey@washjeff.edu ), Psychology Wrestling Buba Misawa ( bmisawa@washjeff.edu ), Political Science Women's Wrestling Jacqueline Heath ( jheath@washjeff.edu ), Psychology Footer Terms of Service , opens in new window Privacy Policy , opens in new window Accessibility Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information Sidearm Sports, opens a new window Ad Blocker Detected Thanks for visiting ! The use of software that blocks ads hinders our ability to serve you the content you came here to enjoy. We ask that you consider turning off your ad blocker so we can deliver you the best experience possible while you are here. Thank you for your support! Learn More About Ad Blockers Close"
